  "chapters": {
    "ch01": {
      "source": "zh/julia/rhc_lessons/ch01.jl",
      "lineCount": 32,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line": 3,
          "code": "include(joinpath(@__DIR__, \"..\", \"..\", \"..\", \"shared\", \"julia\", \"RHCCase.jl\"))",
          "kind": "setup",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputs": [
            "rhc-module"
          ],
          "mathIds": [],
          "formulaTex": null,
          "operation": "include 读取并执行另一个 Julia 文件；joinpath 把路径片段拼起来，@__DIR__ 是当前脚本所在目录，三个 .. 依次返回上三级目录，找到共享 RHCCase.jl。此行载入函数定义，还没有对患者求均值。"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "code": "using .RHCCase",
          "kind": "setup",
          "inputs": [
            "rhc-module"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "rhc-exports",
            "source-path"
          ],
          "mathIds": [],
          "formulaTex": null,
          "operation": "using 把已载入 RHCCase 模块公开的函数名和 DEFAULT_SOURCE 带到当前脚本；模块名前的点表示本地模块。DEFAULT_SOURCE 是原始 CSV 的文件路径，不是患者数据。"
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "code": "rows = read_rhc_rows(DEFAULT_SOURCE)",
          "kind": "read",
          "inputs": [
            "source-path",
            "rhc-exports"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "raw-records"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "raw-cohort"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "\\mathrm{rows}=(r_1,\\ldots,r_n)",
          "operation": "先调用 read_rhc_rows 读取原始 CSV，再用 = 把返回结果存为 rows；每项是一位患者的字段字典，原字段暂存为字符串。输入路径与输出记录是两个对象；读取器检查字段与患者编号，保留全部原始行。"
        },
        {
          "line": 9,
          "code": "observations = rhc_observations(rows)",
          "kind": "encode",
          "inputs": [
            "raw-records"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "observations"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "binary-encoding"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "O_i=(X_i,A_i,Y_i),\\quad Y_i=\\mathbf1\\{\\mathrm{dth30}_i=\\mathrm{Yes}\\}",
          "operation": "将 rows 交给 rhc_observations；按原顺序逐行把 sex、swang1、dth30 编成整数 x、a、y。每条结果是带字段名的 (x,a,y)，不是模型预测，也没有删除患者。"
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "code": "n = length(observations)",
          "kind": "reduce",
          "inputs": [
            "observations"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "sample-size"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "sample-size"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "n=\\operatorname{length}(O_1,\\ldots,O_n)",
          "operation": "length 数容器里有多少条患者记录，把一个整数存入 n；容器有 n 条记录，n 本身只有一个数。"
        },
        {
          "line": 13,
          "code": "y = [person.y for person in observations]",
          "kind": "extract",
          "inputs": [
            "observations"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "outcomes"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "outcomes"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "\\mathbf Y=(Y_1,\\ldots,Y_n)^\\mathsf T",
          "operation": "方括号建立向量；for person in observations 依次取出一位患者，person.y 的点号从该记录取 y 字段。结果 y 保留每位患者的原顺序，长度是 n；Y=0/1 是结局标签，不是数组下标。"
        },
        {
          "line": 15,
          "code": "events = sum(y)",
          "kind": "reduce",
          "inputs": [
            "outcomes"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "events"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "events"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "M=\\sum_{i=1}^nY_i",
          "operation": "sum 将 y 里的 n 个 0/1 相加：死亡者加 1，其他人加 0。输出 events 是死亡总人数这个整数标量，向量在这里收缩成一个数。"
        },
        {
          "line": 17,
          "code": "risk = events / n",
          "kind": "divide",
          "inputs": [
            "events",
            "sample-size"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "risk"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "sample-mean"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "\\widehat\\mu=\\frac{M}{n}=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^nY_i",
          "operation": "先用 / 将死亡人数 events 除以总人数 n，再把结果存为 risk；两个标量相除仍得到一个标量。risk 是全队列死亡比例，不是每位患者的模型预测，也不是处理效应。"
        },
        {
          "line": 19,
          "code": "influence = y .- risk",
          "kind": "broadcast",
          "inputs": [
            "outcomes",
            "risk"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "influence"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "influence"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "D_i=Y_i-\\widehat\\mu,\\quad\\mathbf D=\\mathbf Y-\\widehat\\mu\\mathbf1_n",
          "operation": ".- 中的点表示逐元素相减（broadcast）：给向量 y 的每一个元素都减去同一个标量 risk。输出 influence 仍有 n 项，Y=0 得到负的 risk，Y=1 得到 1-risk；这里没有求平均。",
          "broadcast": {
            "operator": ".-",
            "vector": "outcomes",
            "scalar": "risk",
            "output": "influence"
          }
        },
        {
          "line": 21,
          "code": "mean_influence = sum(influence) / n",
          "kind": "reduce",
          "inputs": [
            "influence",
            "sample-size"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "mean-influence"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "mean-influence"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "\\overline D=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^nD_i=\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n(Y_i-\\widehat\\mu)\\approx0",
          "operation": "sum 先把 n 项 influence 相加，/ n 再除以总人数，得到一个标量 mean_influence。正负影响值在平均时抵消；实数恒等式为 0，浮点运算允许很小的误差；不是每个人的影响值都为 0。"
        },
        {
          "line": 23,
          "code": "data = rhc_data(DEFAULT_SOURCE)",
          "kind": "aggregate",
          "inputs": [
            "source-path"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "coarse-data"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "eight-cell-summary"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "n_j=\\#\\{i:(X_i,A_i,Y_i)=(x_j,a_j,y_j)\\},\\quad\\sum_{j=1}^8n_j=n",
          "operation": "rhc_data 重新读取同一原始 CSV，按 x、a、y 的 0/1 组合统计人数，再返回带字段的 data 容器。data.cells 的每个元素对应一种观测组合，其中 n 是该组合人数；data.n 为总人数5735。"
        },
        {
          "line": 25,
          "code": "check = mean_if(data)",
          "kind": "validate",
          "inputs": [
            "coarse-data"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "mean-check",
            "check-risk",
            "check-values",
            "check-mean"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "weighted-mean"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "\\mathrm{check.risk}=\\sum_{j=1}^8\\frac{n_j}{n}y_j,\\quad\\mathrm{check.mean}=\\sum_{j=1}^8\\frac{n_j}{n}(y_j-\\widehat\\mu)",
          "operation": "mean_if(data) 现在实际调用共享函数，按格人数求死亡比例和影响值加权平均；把返回容器存为 check。check.risk 是死亡比例标量，check.values 是 8 项格影响值，check.mean 是按人数加权的影响值平均，三者不能互换。"
        },
        {
          "line": 27,
          "code": "@assert isapprox(check.risk, risk) && abs(mean_influence) < 1e-12",
          "kind": "assert",
          "inputs": [
            "check-risk",
            "risk",
            "mean-influence"
          ],
          "outputs": [
            "assertion-result"
          ],
          "mathIds": [
            "numerical-check"
          ],
          "formulaTex": "\\mathrm{check.risk}\\approx\\widehat\\mu\\quad\\land\\quad|\\overline D|<10^{-12}",
          "operation": "@assert 要求两个条件同时成立；isapprox 检查按组人数加权的风险与逐人 risk 在默认数值容差内接近，&& 表示并且，abs 取绝对值，1e-12 是 10 的负 12 次方。成功继续，失败报错停止；此行没有重新拟合模型，也未直接检查 check.mean。"
        },
